  "prefLabel": "Env-A 804.20 Fixed-roof VOC Storage Tanks",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 804.20 Fixed-roof VOC Storage Tanks. When performing a visual inspection of the internal floating roof and its closure seal(s) as required by Env-A 1200, the owner or operator of a fixed-roof VOC storage tank shall inspect for all of the following:\n\n(a) The cover shall be uniformly floating on or above the liquid;\n\n(b) The surface of the cover shall have no visible defects;\n\n(c) The cover shall have no accumulated liquid; and\n\n(d) The seal shall be intact and uniformly in place around the circumference of the cover between the cover and tank wall.\n\nSource. #7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #9802, eff 10-31-10 (from Env-A 804.18); ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
